{"id":"30-1244-2-4","zh":"247.","confidence":95}
{"id":"30-1245-2-7","zh":"事情一旦办完，","confidence":85}
{"id":"30-1246-2-4","zh":"就没有人再看重办事的人；","confidence":80}
